{"t": 1794124016.4569025, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"project_id": "acme/billing-legacy", "merge_request_iid": "12", "body": "Diagnosed main pipeline 8812 (a91c2e0): lint passed, but job 77104 (test:contract) failed contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format. The logged FIN-77 contract requires invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"; the implementation returns \"INV-2026-42\".\n\nApplied the minimal fix to the local working copy, billing/invoice.py: return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\". This zero-pads the sequence to a minimum width of six digits without truncating longer sequences. Executed the exact failing assertion locally against the changed implementation: PASS.\n\nDelivery blocker: this working directory has no Git metadata; GitLab repository-file reads returned empty results, no repository-write tool was discoverable, and git ls-remote https://gitlab.com/acme/billing-legacy.git failed because credentials were unavailable. Consequently the fix is LOCAL ONLY: it has not been pushed to erp-v2 or main, and I cannot claim that CI is green. The full contract suite was not available locally. Commit the one-line change to this MR and run its pipeline before merging and verifying main."}, "ok": true}
